msgid "Corporation token missing"
msgstr "缺少 Corporation 令牌"

#: checks.py:167
msgid ""
"No character of the Corporation has a token with the scopes the Corporation "
"audit needs."
msgstr "该 Corporation 没有任何 Character 拥有 Corporation 审计所需 Scope 的令牌。"

#: checks.py:168
msgid ""
"A Director adds a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中添加 Corporation 令牌。"

#: checks.py:175
msgid "Corporation data stale"
msgstr "Corporation 数据已过期"

#: checks.py:176
msgid "A section of the Corporation audit has not updated within the limit."
msgstr "Corporation 审计的某个部分未在期限内更新。"

#: checks.py:178
msgid ""
"A Director checks the Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit "
"and adds a new one if it lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中检查 Corporation 令牌，如其已失去角色则添加新令牌。"

#: checks.py:187
msgid "No structure owner"
msgstr "没有建筑所有者"

#: checks.py:188
msgid "The Corporation is not set up as an owner in aa-structures."
msgstr "该 Corporation 未在 aa-structures 中设置为所有者。"

#: checks.py:189
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds the Corporation as an owner "
"in aa-structures."
msgstr ""
"由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 aa-structures 中将该 Corporation 添加为所有者。"

#: checks.py:196
msgid "Structure owner inactive"
msgstr "建筑所有者未启用"

#: checks.py:197
msgid "The aa-structures owner of the Corporation is switched off."
msgstr "该 Corporation 的 aa-structures 所有者已被关闭。"

#: checks.py:198
msgid "An admin switches the owner on again in the aa-structures admin."
msgstr "由管理员在 aa-structures 管理后台重新启用该所有者。"

#: checks.py:204
msgid "No structure owner character"
msgstr "没有建筑所有者 Character"

#: checks.py:205
msgid ""
"The aa-structures owner has no enabled character left to fetch data with."
msgstr "该 aa-structures 所有者没有剩余的已启用 Character 可用于获取数据。"

#: checks.py:206
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds itself to the owner in aa-"
"structures."
msgstr "由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 aa-structures 中将自己添加到该所有者。"

#: checks.py:213
msgid "Structure sync failing"
msgstr "建筑同步失败"

#: checks.py:214
msgid "aa-structures reports a sync that is not up to date."
msgstr "aa-structures 报告有同步未保持最新。"

#: checks.py:215
msgid ""
"Check the owner in aa-structures: its characters may have lost the Station "
"Manager role."
msgstr "请在 aa-structures 中检查该所有者：其 Character 可能已失去 Station Manager 角色。"

